1
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:38,000
Scenes from an Empty Church is a drama film directed by Onur Tukel.

2
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:10,000
In a locked-down NYC, two priests open their church doors to those
seeking salvation during the most isolating of times.

3
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:42,000
From the commonplace to the truly metaphysical, their visitors reflect
the full spectrum of personal crises of spirituality.

4
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:14,000
Throughout their encounters with the city's sweetest, wildest and weirdest, the two
priests learn the importance of connection, empathy and open-mindedness.

5
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:46,000
Sometimes a little faith is all you need to make it through the bad times.

